WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.528
Step 1. Open the Users tab. Assigning a user gives that user access to this patient,

1.2
00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:09.271
with the role that you choose.

2.1
00:00:09.271 --> 00:00:12.309
Step 2. Open the Assign User panel.

2.2
00:00:12.309 --> 00:00:17.510
Select Assign User, to search for a user and assign a role.

3.1
00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:23.317
Step 3. Select the user. Search by first name, last name or username.

3.2
00:00:23.317 --> 00:00:29.293
The search covers all users in Care, not only this facility's users.

4.1
00:00:29.293 --> 00:00:33.716
Step 4. Select the role. In Select Role, choose a role.

4.2
00:00:33.716 --> 00:00:38.767
The user gets that role's permissions for this patient only.

5.1
00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:43.059
Step 5. Assign the user. Select Assign to Patient.

5.2
00:00:43.059 --> 00:00:48.975
Care shows User added to patient successfully and closes the panel.

6.1
00:00:48.975 --> 00:00:55.340
Step 6. Remove an assigned user. On the user's card, select the trash button.

6.2
00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:59.811
Check the name in Remove User, then select Remove.
